# Sidisi, Regent of the Mire: X is the mana value of the creature sacrificed, so a Phyrexian Walker (mana value 0) makes X = 0 and the
# target has mana value 0 plus 1 (CR 107.3a, 202.3). Bot2 Bolts Bog Rats on turn 2 and Child of Night on turn 3, so Bot1's graveyard holds a
# creature card with mana value 1 and one with mana value 2: with X = 0 announced, the Child (mana value 2) is refused as a target and the
# Rats are chosen. Sidisi (mana value 2) is not what X = 2 would sacrifice ("other than Sidisi"), and Walker is the only fodder.

